# A config file with an option that says what to do, not how to format: file:line: message, exit 2,
# and nothing formatted.
program Opp
arg --config
arg tests/data/config/bad-forbidden.conf
arg tests/data/fmt-align.Mod
status 2
output
opp: tests/data/config/bad-forbidden.conf:1: --in-place cannot be in a config file
